'use strict';
// Keyward UI language. The UI is written in Traditional Chinese; in English mode every rendered
// text node and a few attributes are translated from the table below as the page changes, so the
// rest of the code never needs to know the language. Messages from the Go core arrive in Chinese
// too and go through the same table.
//
// Long pieces are replaced wherever they appear (values such as names, numbers and times sit
// between them); short pieces (fewer than 3 Chinese characters) only when they are the whole text,
// so a user's own item names are not touched.

