'為了在鎖定時也能用驗證碼解鎖，資料金鑰會另外由 Windows 以你目前的使用者帳號保護一份，寄信設定也以同樣方式保存。這表示：同一個 Windows 帳號下執行的程式（包括能執行指令的 AI 工具）有機會不經驗證碼就解開資料。驗證碼是 Keyward 的放行規則，不是加密金鑰。在意這點請只用主密碼。': 'So that a code can unlock the vault while it is locked, Windows also protects a copy of the data key with your current user account, and the mail settings are stored the same way. This means programs running under the same Windows account (including AI tools that can run commands) could open the data without a code. The code is a Keyward rule, not an encryption key. If that matters to you, use only the master password.',
